      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Vyolynce\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/vyolynce/48/2397_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Vyolynce:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>so if you've already found a couple that card basically reads \"reshuffle the deck\".</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Id be careful with that. Again, you ONLY reshuffle the deck when you have to DRAW from the deck or DISCARD from the deck. Any time else, that deck remains gone and the trash pile still full.</p>",
