      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Vyolynce wrote:</b><br><blockquote>so if you've already found a couple that card basically reads \"reshuffle the deck\".\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nId be careful with that. Again, you ONLY reshuffle the deck when you have to DRAW from the deck or DISCARD from the deck. Any time else, that deck remains gone and the trash pile still full.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Well I was paraphrasing. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"><br><br>But yes, I should have said \"basically reads 'flip the deck into the trash'.\"</p>",
