      "id": 62775,
      "name": "Ronway",
      "username": "Ronway",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-05-09T20:41:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Pydro\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/48/1844_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Pydro:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Just keep in mind that during the environment turn you dont play a card, you reveal a card. If the deck was empty, you would just skip that part until another effects says to draw or discard a card.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>No no no. Reveal effects from other cards would prevent it from reshuffling. Revealing a card and playing it would still activate during the environments play phase and thus cause a reshuffle. They probably should of worded it slightly differently to avoid that kind of confusion.</p>",
